 "comment": [
  "Curated weapon-type overrides for Realms of Luminari source objects whose",
  "text is evocative but names no standard weapon. Keys are source object",
  "vnums; weapon_type names a WEAPON_TYPE_* constant from src/structs.h.",
  "Loaded by wtool_lib/rol_weapon_mapping.py as inference tier 1, ahead of the",
  "keyword rules and the mechanical fallback matrix.",
  "Builder placeholders (the 7073-7098 quest-weapon templates, the noshow",
  "records, the standard god weapon) are deliberately absent: the fallback",
  "matrix already reproduces the verb and handedness they were built to carry,",
  "which is exactly what those records are for.",
  "Ranged weapon types are rejected at load. A source ITEM_WEAPON is a melee",
  "record, so a converted bow or ballista becomes the melee weapon it is",
  "actually swung as."
 ],
